When you go through the main dungeon, you will encounter a level with a
magic teleporter and the associated message. Let's call this Level A. The
teleporter takes you to Level B, the first level of another branch. The
quest leader and the entrance to the Tower of Darkness is on B. To find
the entrance, search in the castle; it is not a portal. Medusa lives in
A's branch, further down.

The basic situation (entrance to the quest branch, test for eligibility,
progress downwards in the B branch, do something at the bottom) is the
same for all character classes, but the actual layout and inhabitants of
the quest vary.

